# Sveltia CMS / posts

Pending work: `.cursor/plans/sveltia-cms.md` (hub). Current phase: **remote `/admin`** (PAT). Local Repository optional for maintainer spikes. Do not invent a parallel auth or soft-launch approach.

## Must preserve

- Pin `@sveltia/cms` in `admin/index.html` and matching schema URL in `admin/config.yml` (same version). Renovate regex manager bumps both together (`groupName: sveltia cms`); merge only after checking release notes — no automerge. YouTube Insert via `CMS.registerEditorComponent` (writes `{% youtube "…" %}`). Temporary scroll-to-top on entry open (reset `.content`); no IndexedDB UI seeding.
- Backend: GitHub + `auth_methods: [token]` (PAT on production `/admin`). No client secret in this repo. OAuth stays parked until un-parked explicitly.
- Workflow: simple commit to `main` (not editorial). `skip_ci: false` — Save triggers Pages; change only on purpose.
- i18n: `multiple_files`, `default_locale: it`, `omit_default_locale_from_file_path: true` → `Stem.md` / `Stem.en.md` / `Stem.fr.md`.
- `lang`: hidden widget, `default: "{{locale}}"`, `i18n: true` — never a manual select.
- Dates: `type: date` (ISO). Day.js — `YYYY-MM-DD` / not `yyyy-MM-dd` (`dd` is weekday).
- Slugs: `encoding: ascii`, `clean_accents: true`, `lowercase: false`; post slug `{{year}}-{{month}}-{{day}}-{{slug}}`.
- Cover and body media: `media_folder` / `public_folder` both `/assets/img/posts` (leading slash on public — required for thumbnails). Front matter `img: /assets/img/posts/…`. Uploads: `media_libraries.all.slugify_filename: true` (uses global `slug` options; keeps `content_lint` space rule happy).
- About / bio: `_data/about.yml` (locale keys `it`/`en`/`fr`); CMS file collection **Pagine → Chi sono** with `i18n: true` on collection and file. Do not put about fields only in `site-text.yml` (CMS would wipe sibling keys on save).
- `output.omit_empty_optional_fields: true`.
- Republication: CMS writes optional object `republication` (`publisher` + `publication_link`). Existing posts may still use flat keys; lint accepts either shape (not both). Template reads both.
